      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "1) Initialize a BV Implementation Universal Set to {0} and minWeight = INF\nAlso declare and initialize a temp array and tempCount = 0\n2) Loop to initialize your smallestCosts to your respective vertex starting point's costs.\n3) Looping\n    Outer Loop (x = 1 ; x < MAX ; x++){\n        // Difference Loop (get all vertices that are marked 0/not visited)\n        Loop (y = 0 ; y < MAX ; y++){\n            // if visited == 0\n            if (!visited[U[y]]){\n                temp[tempCount] = y;\n                tempCount++;\n            }\n        }\n        // Once I have difference of U-Visited, I use them for getting min\n        Loop (y = 0 ; y < tempCount ; y++){\n            if (smallestCosts[temp[y]] < minWeight){\n                minWeight = smallestCost[temp[y]];\n                minNdx = temp[y];\n            }\n        }\n        visited[minNdx] = 1;\n        \n        // For each Vertex in difference (temp array), do D[v] = min(D[v], D[w] + C[w,v]);\n        Loop (y = 1 ; y < tempCount ; y++){\n            if (D[temp[y] == 0){\n                D[temp[y]] = min(D[temp[y]], D[\n            }\n        }\n        \n    }",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1) Initialize a BV Implementation Universal Set to {0} and minWeight = INF\nAlso declare and initialize a temp array and tempCount = 0\n2) Loop to initialize your smallestCosts to your respective vertex starting point's costs.\n3) Looping\n    Outer Loop (x = 1 ; x < MAX ; x++){\n        // Difference Loop (get all vertices that are marked 0/not visited)\n        Loop (y = 0 ; y < MAX ; y++){\n            // if visited == 0\n            if (!visited[U[y]]){\n                temp[tempCount] = y;\n                tempCount++;\n            }\n        }\n        // Once I have difference of U-Visited, I use them for getting min\n        Loop (y = 0 ; y < tempCount ; y++){\n            if (smallestCosts[temp[y]] < minWeight){\n                minWeight = smallestCost[temp[y]];\n                minNdx = temp[y];\n            }\n        }\n        visited[minNdx] = 1;\n        \n        // For each Vertex in difference (temp array), do D[v] = min(D[v], D[w] + C[w,v]);\n        Loop (y = 1 ; y < tempCount ; y++){\n            if (D[temp[y] == 0){\n                D[temp[y]] = min(D[temp[y]], D[\n            }\n        }\n        \n    }",
      "lineHeight": 1.15
    },
